Calling all fairytale navigators — PAX Online is finally here and, alongside it, The Darkest Tales demo has made a triumphant comeback! 

Thanks to your feedback, several changes have been implemented into the latest version:
[list]
[*] improved jump animation and air control;
[*] improved Teddy's unarmed walk and run cycles;
[*] improved basic moves' visual effects;
[*] made the intro skippable;
[*] revamped the skill equipment screen;
[*] improved hit detection and the overall battle system;
[*] added shiny enemy outlines for easier monster-slaying;
[*] taught the carnivorous flora to react when it's getting hit;
[*] put in many other minor changes and improvements.
[/list]


Check the updated demo, tell us what you think by filling in a quick survey, and, of course, share the news and excitement with your friends!

And, if you happen to be a fan of post-apocalypse and Japanese folklore, check out the demo for another one of our projects, the action-packed platformer [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/1294880/Blind_Fate_Edo_no_Yami/]Blind Fate: Edo no Yami[/url]!

